    38	- Symptom: a server silently fails to load. Cause: the singular MCP TOML table is visually easy to miss. Fix: compare with a working server, run `codex mcp list`, then directly `initialize` and `list_tools` before claiming success. [Task 1]
    39	- Symptom: an enabled server exposes zero tools. Cause: the exact-name allow list filtered every advertised tool. Fix: compare live `list_tools` output with `enabled_tools`; omit the filter or update it to current names. [Task 2]
